      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=120%><color=\"yellow\">How to Play</color></size>\n\u2022 The goal
    is getting the marble to run through the entire loop returning to the starting
    point.\n\u2022 Use the objects in the left drawer to complete the loop.\n\u2022
    Use the Playback controls at the bottom to move the marble or reset the scene.\n<size=120%><color=\"yellow\">Controls</color></size>\nPress
    and hold <sprite name=ml> to move objects\nPress <sprite name=w> or <sprite name=s>
    to flip vertically\nPress <sprite name=a> or <sprite name=d> to flip horizontally\nPress
    <sprite name=q> or <sprite name=e> to rotate clockwise and counter-clockwise
    respectively\n"
